    priorities.
  </p>

  <h3>Step 2: Ad creation</h3>
  <p>
    Our team builds ad creative and copy designed to attract and convert your ideal
    patients.
  </p>

  <h3>Step 3: Targeting optimization</h3>
  <p>
    We configure audiences, locations, and placements to reach the right people at the
    right cost.
  </p>

  <h3>Step 4: Campaign management</h3>
  <p>
    We monitor performance daily and adjust bids, audiences, and creative based on real
    data.
  </p>

  <h3>Step 5: Results analysis</h3>
  <p>
    Detailed reports show what is working and where to improve next.
  </p>

  <h2>Maximize your Facebook marketing budget</h2>
  <p>
    Strategic targeting, strong creative, and ongoing optimization turn your Facebook budget
    into a reliable patient acquisition channel. ChiroCandy helps you get more from every
    dollar spent.
  </p>

  <h2>Facebook vs. other channels for chiropractic practices</h2>
  <p>
    Facebook ads excel at building awareness and retargeting website visitors. Google Ads
    capture active search intent. SEO builds long-term organic traffic. The strongest
    practices use Facebook alongside these channels rather than relying on one source.
  </p>
  <p>
    ChiroCandy coordinates your Facebook campaigns with landing pages, SEO, and follow-up
    systems so leads do not fall through the cracks.
  </p>

  <h2>What makes chiropractic Facebook ads different</h2>
  <p>
    Health services advertising has platform-specific rules. Chiropractic messaging must
    balance education with compliance. ChiroCandy knows which claims perform, which
    creative formats convert, and how to structure offers that attract patients without
    triggering ad disapproval.
  </p>

  <h2>Grow your practice with chiropractic Facebook ads</h2>
  <p>
    Partner with ChiroCandy to launch Facebook ad campaigns built for your market. We
    handle the technical work so you can focus on patient care while new appointments come
    in.
  </p>
</ServiceLayout>
